        "text_UPBCX4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bacton Health Services exists to make perimenopause and menopause easier to navigate. Midlife brings real changes - to sleep, energy, comfort and confidence - and too many women are left to sort through them alone. We built Bacton to be the partner we could not find: clear information, carefully selected products, and personal support for every stage of the transition.</p><p>Our approach pairs thoughtfully selected supplements, chosen for the symptoms women actually report, with an AI-driven Information Resource Center that puts current, evidence-based answers about menopause care in one place. The goal is simple: help you understand your options, make confident decisions about your health, and feel more like yourself again. That idea is in our name - Bacton comes from \"back to normal.\"</p>",
